{"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To","type":"conformsTo","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Relation","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s15BitwiseCopyableP","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/Se","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/SE","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/SQ","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/SH","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s16SendableMetatypeP"]}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Building Hierarchies","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/RelatingEntities","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/AncestorsView","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/DescendantsView","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/CyclicHierarchy","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/HierarchyError"],"anchor":"Building-Hierarchies"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@frozen"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ChildOf"}]}]},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/ReactingToChanges","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/RelatingEntities","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/SavingAndLoadingWorlds"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A hierarchy groups entities into trees: a ship and its turrets, a menu and its buttons. Each"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"entity has at most one parent, and despawning a parent despawns its children, and theirs in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"turn. Build a hierarchy with "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/addChild(_:to:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":", which refuses a link that would make"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"an entity its own ancestor, and walk it with "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/parent(of:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/children(of:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/ancestors(of:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/descendants(of:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The following example attaches a turret and an engine to a ship, then despawns the ship,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"which takes its parts with it:","type":"text"}]},{"code":["var world = World()","let ship = world.spawn(Name(value: \"Ship\"))","let turret = world.spawn(Name(value: \"Turret\"))","let engine = world.spawn(Name(value: \"Engine\"))","try world.addChild(turret, to: ship)","try world.addChild(engine, to: ship)","","let parts = world.children(of: ship).map { world[Name.self, of: $0].value }","print(parts)","\/\/ Prints \"[\"Turret\", \"Engine\"]\"","","world.despawn(ship)","print(world.contains(engine))","\/\/ Prints \"false\""],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ChildOf"},{"text":" is a ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Relation"},{"text":" like any other, so an entity with a parent holds a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Targets<ChildOf>"},{"text":" component naming it. Queries use that to find the entities at each level","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of a tree:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".related(ChildOf.self, to: parent)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" keeps the children of ","type":"text"},{"code":"parent","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".with(Targets<ChildOf>.self)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" keeps entities that have a parent."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".without(Targets<ChildOf>.self)"},{"text":" keeps the roots.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"code":["var world = World()","let menu = world.spawn(Name(value: \"Menu\"))","let play = world.spawn(Name(value: \"Play\"))","let quit = world.spawn(Name(value: \"Quit\"))","try world.addChild(play, to: menu)","try world.addChild(quit, to: menu)","","print(world.query(Name.self).related(ChildOf.self, to: menu).count)","\/\/ Prints \"2\"","print(world.query(Name.self).without(Targets<ChildOf>.self).count)","\/\/ Prints \"1\""],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/worldmodule\/childof"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"WorldModule"}],"role":"symbol","title":"ChildOf","remoteSource":{"fileName":"Hierarchy.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/ECS\/blob\/main\/Sources\/WorldModule\/Hierarchy.swift#L51"},"externalID":"s:11WorldModule7ChildOfV","symbolKind":"struct","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ChildOf"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"ChildOf","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Structure"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule"]]},"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/ChildOf"},"topicSect